ng like this, if it is a tax law, if it is a treaty, We are very strict on the two-thirds. We are very strict on the numbers. And so, I just wanted to put that on record, Mr. Presiding Officer, Mr. Senate President, and I really wanted to be clear on this particular matter. Thank you very much, Mr. President.

